{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:39 2026-11-17 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"石鼓洲I.PARK1焚化爐三級火 消防處：可能肇於吸煙或燒焊\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b8d855bb0582d048e56c6a1750cb7d3c/2026-11/collage_70.jpg\"/>\n<p>石鼓洲旁人工島綜合廢物管理設施第一期（I.PARK1）上月26日發生三級火。消防處今日（11月17日）表示已完成現場蒐證、向相關人士錄取口供等調查工作，顯示起火地點位於I.PARK1焚化爐大樓第三焚化模組高層位置。調查結果已排除火警與電力故障、蓄意縱火及化學物質自燃有關，起因可能與燒焊工程或吸煙有關。消防處已完成有關報告，並轉交環境保護署跟進。</p>\n<p>火警發生在10月26日中午12時許，至下午1時許升為三級，消防動用5喉5煙帽隊在場撲救，近千工人需要乘船疏散。火警焚燒4小時後被救熄，一名60歲男職員協助救火時不適，獲直升機送院治理。</p>\n<img alt=\"不適男子獲直升機送東區醫院治理。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84bfdb3b591e542e7524898f99d7b662/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_16_58_57.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"火場內部有棚架焚燒。工人提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65ab64a8ec6cc7cc5ac7f55608135b8e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_15_57_55.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網傳火場內部照片。Threads：xxawm\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef591fe3d491e99f94f5aad7798849d9/2026-10/864734701_17951964132313411_2160442176227634639_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"濃煙直衝半空。Threads：xxawm\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e668dd2494cbf9e56269127afbfd613/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-26-15h24m31s546.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批工人疏散。Threads：xxawm\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a54f9317f4ea6d5177e04915b9f7b0a/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-26-15h24m37s153.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"焚化廠濃煙離遠可見。Threads：goblin_under\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f951557f3310749a6bb544ae443a85ec/2026-10/0007bd4d-bf86-48ec-bffb-4ff01697a9c0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防輪出動撲救。FB：香港交通及突發事故報料區\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d9be3e46f39638911289654b3e989e5/2026-10/862466770_3812224962249762_4627306610186283828_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"工人坐船疏散。Threads：edward.chung_\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/471993ca6ef5606a03158202df56374e/2026-10/i3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"疏散工人坐船至荃灣碼頭離開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b923c5fe6c364d24ad3c2d1fd3f07aa/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_15_48_17.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"疏散工人坐船至荃灣碼頭離開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b85febfd2066b0625490f881f7c5539/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_15_48_18.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"疏散工人坐船至荃灣碼頭離開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3e924ea860e6e8e5795fc8c92f5c4c9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_15_48_18_1_.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:50:22.075413+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":292,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T07:39:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:17.453755+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:43:47.674823+00:00","content_hash":"0828657d0cf5fa1e2dbb202ff413b3e94c2aec76c2f75e281e28137ee18ea383","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}